{
  "name": "SpecForge Ember",
  "source": "Adapted from the Apex Code Ember palette. Dark is primary. Light uses a neutral ground, not cream.",
  "notes": [
    "Three text greys plus content white. dim for labels, muted for values, text for content.",
    "line is a decorative hairline with no contrast floor. field is a control boundary and clears 3:1 per WCAG 1.4.11.",
    "Light-mode ember is a separate value, darkened to clear 4.5:1 on white. The dark hex must not be reused."
